<noinclude>{{Documentationpage}}</noinclude>
Auxiliary template for {{tl|Infobox}}.

==Usage==
<pre>{{abb|abbreviation}}</pre>

==Parameters==
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"aliases": [
				"abb"
			],
			"label": "Abb",
			"description": "Game abbrevation; see Template:Abb for list of valid inputs.",
			"type": "string",
			"required": true
		},
		"mode": {
			"label": "Mode",
			"description": "Determines the template output.",
			"example": "Available options: icon, link, short, text",
			"type": "string",
			"required": true
		}
	},
	"description": "Small template which retrieves the name of a ''Fallout'' game for a given user entry."
}
</templatedata>

==Available options for <nowiki>{{{mode|}}}</nowiki>==
* ''icon'': Returns the name of the game's icon (without "File:" prefix).
* ''link'': Returns the name of the game's overview article.
* ''short'': Returns a shortened version of the game's name for display in narrow spaces.
* ''text'': Returns the game's name.

==Abbreviations==
<section begin="abbrevations" />
{| class="va-table sortable" style="text-align:center;"
! Abbreviation
! text
! short
! link
! class="unsortable" | icon
|-
| '''Wiki'''
| {{abb|Wiki}}
| {{abb|mode=short|Wiki}}
| [[{{abb|mode=link|Wiki}}]]
| [[File:{{abb|mode=icon|Wiki}}|x40px]]
|}
<section end="abbrevations" />

===Adding new abbrevations===
New abbreviations need adding to [[Module:Abb/data]]

Please note:
* The abbreviation needs to be in all-uppercase.
* Icon file names should be specified without "File:" prefix.
In addition, please try to maintain alphabetical order of abbreviations within the template.

==Examples==
{| class="va-table"
|-
! Input
! Result
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{abb|Wiki}}</nowiki></code>
| {{abb|Wiki}}
|}